WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.000
Do you remember the glowing eyes you had as a child when you went to the Christmas market?

00:00:05.000 --> 00:00:08.000
Without this strange feeling in your stomach?

00:00:08.000 --> 00:00:12.000
Do you remember how it was when you could celebrate without any worries?

00:00:12.000 --> 00:00:15.000
Without constantly looking around at your way home?

00:00:15.000 --> 00:00:18.000
Do you remember how unmoved your school days were?

00:00:18.000 --> 00:00:21.000
Without talahorns and fear?

00:00:21.000 --> 00:00:25.000
Do you remember how it was before the year of fate 2015?

00:00:25.000 --> 00:00:28.000
When the CDU opened the borders?

00:00:28.000 --> 00:00:34.560
Do you really believe that the same CDU will now solve all the problems it has caused?

00:00:34.560 --> 00:00:37.280
Let's get our country back together.

00:00:37.280 --> 00:00:40.760
Therefore on February 23rd, AfD.

00:00:40.760 --> 00:00:43.520
Time for Germany. Time for Alice Weidel.
